        "filename": "Toki Messe Observation Deck.jpg",
        "caption": "The Befco Bakauke Observation Deck, located on the 31st floor of the Toki Messe building in Niigata, Japan, offers a panoramic 360-degree view at a height of approximately 125 meters. On clear days, visitors can see Sado Island, the Shinano River, and the Sea of Japan. The observation area is open from 8:00 to 22:00, and admission is free. In addition to its scenic views, the deck features a café lounge and a souvenir shop.",
